"""
Combined Animation & Gizmo Tools - v1.9.1 (Blender 5.1+)

Timeline / Dope Sheet / Graph Editor header
    - Action selector (New / Duplicate) + slot selector for slotted actions
    - Undo / Redo buttons
    - "Action to Scene Range" button
Graph Editor (right-click menu and Key menu)
    - Paste Connect
3D View > Sidebar > Tool
    - Gizmo Tools panel (gizmo size)
"""

